<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="The Ray of Light"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Light"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Vivienne"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Increase Beat"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Increase Beat(FELT 22nd Album)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="557579321"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="42886855"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ArSrNa"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Vivienne</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:12.352"><div begin="0.503" end="3:12.352"><p begin="0.503" end="5.107" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.503" end="0.909">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="0.909" end="1.183">been</span> <span begin="1.183" end="1.725">looking</span> <span begin="1.725" end="2.038">for</span> <span begin="2.038" end="2.182">the</span> <span begin="2.182" end="2.896">light</span> <span begin="3.279" end="3.540">in</span> <span begin="3.540" end="4.184">the</span> <span begin="4.184" end="4.513">dark</span><span begin="4.513" end="5.107">ness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">曾几何时 我在黑夜寻找光明</span></p><p begin="5.577" end="9.682" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.577" end="5.914">And</span> <span begin="5.914" end="6.219">rea</span><span begin="6.219" end="6.558">ching</span> <span begin="6.558" end="6.846">for</span> <span begin="6.846" end="7.159">the</span> <span begin="7.159" end="7.699">stars</span> <span begin="7.699" end="8.322">to</span> <span begin="8.322" end="8.863">be</span> <span begin="8.863" end="9.682">free</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">幻想摘下那星辰 去拥有自由</span></p><p begin="10.424" end="12.578" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.424" end="10.771">How</span><span begin="10.771" end="11.348">ever,</span> <span begin="11.348" end="11.641">still</span> <span begin="11.641" end="12.578">can&apos;t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管仍未实现</span></p><p begin="12.884" end="15.530" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.884" end="13.199">It</span> <span begin="13.199" end="13.504">seems</span> <span begin="13.504" end="13.797">like</span> <span begin="13.797" end="14.089">that</span> <span begin="14.089" end="14.631">takes</span> <span begin="14.631" end="15.530">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好似蹉跎岁月</span></p><p begin="19.760" end="24.361" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.760" end="20.053">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="20.053" end="20.368">been</span> <span begin="20.368" end="20.993">wandering</span> <span begin="20.993" end="21.287">in</span> <span begin="21.287" end="21.412">the</span> <span begin="21.412" end="22.081">sky</span> <span begin="22.461" end="22.717">for</span> <span begin="22.717" end="22.864">a</span> <span begin="22.864" end="23.634">long</span> <span begin="23.634" end="24.361">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">曾几何时 我在苍穹中徘徊</span></p><p begin="24.825" end="28.873" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.825" end="25.169">While</span> <span begin="25.169" end="25.760">wishing</span> <span begin="25.760" end="26.112">for</span> <span begin="26.112" end="26.446">the</span> <span begin="26.446" end="27.500">truly</span> <span begin="27.500" end="28.873">future</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">幻想获得真正的未来</span></p><p begin="30.513" end="34.695" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.513" end="31.344">Believe</span> <span begin="31.344" end="31.982">that</span> <span begin="31.982" end="32.362">will</span> <span begin="32.362" end="32.657">be</span> <span begin="32.657" end="33.244">coming</span> <span begin="33.244" end="34.695">surely</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">相信那一定会到来</span></p><p begin="35.526" end="38.518" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.526" end="35.918">No</span> <span begin="35.918" end="36.115">ma</span><span begin="36.115" end="36.510">tter</span> <span begin="36.510" end="36.822">how</span> <span begin="36.822" end="37.157">long</span> <span begin="37.157" end="37.682">it</span> <span begin="37.682" end="38.518">takes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管那会花费时间</span></p><p begin="39.152" end="43.185" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.152" end="39.499">So,</span> <span begin="39.499" end="39.772">Let</span> <span begin="39.772" end="39.955">me</span> <span begin="39.955" end="40.303">take</span> <span begin="40.303" end="40.637">you</span> <span begin="40.637" end="41.401">down</span> <span begin="41.644" end="41.809">to</span> <span begin="41.809" end="42.037">a</span> <span begin="42.037" end="42.721">radiant</span> <span begin="42.721" end="43.185">place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以 请同我进入一个流光溢彩的地域</span></p><p begin="43.185" end="47.864" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.185" end="43.751">If</span> <span begin="43.751" end="44.325">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="44.325" end="44.587">with</span> <span begin="44.587" end="44.921">you,</span> <span begin="44.921" end="45.210">we</span> <span begin="45.210" end="45.793">can</span> <span begin="45.793" end="46.401">go</span> <span begin="46.401" end="46.939">any</span><span begin="46.939" end="47.864">where</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我心有你 我们可以到达任何地方</span></p><p begin="48.781" end="53.152" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.781" end="49.080">The</span> <span begin="49.080" end="49.536">light</span> <span begin="49.536" end="50.651">promising</span> <span begin="50.651" end="50.972">the</span> <span begin="50.972" end="51.584">future</span> <span begin="51.584" end="52.044">will</span> <span begin="52.044" end="52.427">lead</span> <span begin="52.427" end="53.152">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">曙光向我保证 未来会引领我的路</span></p><p begin="53.622" end="57.585" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.622" end="53.939">So</span> <span begin="53.939" end="54.241">that</span> <span begin="54.241" end="54.526">the</span> <span begin="54.526" end="54.954">dark</span><span begin="54.954" end="55.248">ness</span> <span begin="55.248" end="55.794">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="55.794" end="56.261">be</span> <span begin="56.261" end="57.585">approaching</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以黑夜不会降临</span></p><p begin="58.430" end="1:02.743" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.430" end="58.710">I</span> <span begin="58.710" end="58.984">caught</span> <span begin="58.984" end="59.318">a</span> <span begin="59.318" end="59.611">ray</span> <span begin="59.611" end="59.776">of</span> <span begin="59.776" end="1:00.360">light</span> <span begin="1:00.874" end="1:01.196">in</span> <span begin="1:01.196" end="1:01.475">a</span> <span begin="1:01.475" end="1:01.974">night</span><span begin="1:01.974" end="1:02.743">mare</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在噩梦中发现了一线光明</span></p><p begin="1:03.254" end="1:07.281" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.254" end="1:03.538">As</span> <span begin="1:03.538" end="1:03.869">if</span> <span begin="1:03.869" end="1:04.194">it</span> <span begin="1:04.194" end="1:04.481">was</span> <span begin="1:04.481" end="1:04.762">the</span> <span begin="1:04.762" end="1:05.283">last</span> <span begin="1:05.283" end="1:05.904">hope</span> <span begin="1:05.904" end="1:06.476">for</span> <span begin="1:06.476" end="1:07.281">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是我最后的希望</span></p><p begin="1:08.034" end="1:13.672" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.034" end="1:08.322">How</span><span begin="1:08.322" end="1:08.960">ever,</span> <span begin="1:08.960" end="1:09.259">so</span> <span begin="1:09.259" end="1:10.074">faint,</span> <span begin="1:10.255" end="1:10.851">also</span> <span begin="1:10.851" end="1:11.474">likely</span> <span begin="1:11.474" end="1:11.695">to</span> <span begin="1:11.695" end="1:12.218">dis</span><span begin="1:12.218" end="1:13.672">appear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管 很渺茫 很微弱</span></p><p begin="1:17.646" end="1:21.918" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.646" end="1:17.962">I</span> <span begin="1:17.962" end="1:18.216">saw</span> <span begin="1:18.216" end="1:18.520">a</span> <span begin="1:18.520" end="1:18.911">shooting</span> <span begin="1:18.911" end="1:19.516">star</span> <span begin="1:19.756" end="1:20.025">at</span> <span begin="1:20.025" end="1:20.331">the</span> <span begin="1:20.331" end="1:20.650">crack</span> <span begin="1:20.650" end="1:21.210">of</span> <span begin="1:21.210" end="1:21.918">dawn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我看见一颗流星划破黎明</span></p><p begin="1:22.414" end="1:27.546" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.414" end="1:22.748">And</span> <span begin="1:22.748" end="1:23.049">It</span> <span begin="1:23.049" end="1:23.375">looked</span> <span begin="1:23.375" end="1:23.671">like</span> <span begin="1:23.671" end="1:23.971">knows</span> <span begin="1:23.971" end="1:25.172">reasons</span> <span begin="1:25.172" end="1:25.720">that</span> <span begin="1:25.720" end="1:26.014">we</span> <span begin="1:26.014" end="1:27.546">live</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那就是我为什么活着</span></p><p begin="1:28.456" end="1:32.504" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.456" end="1:28.707">To</span> <span begin="1:28.707" end="1:29.024">will</span> <span begin="1:29.024" end="1:29.157">be</span> <span begin="1:29.157" end="1:29.523">like</span> <span begin="1:29.523" end="1:29.662">the</span> <span begin="1:29.662" end="1:30.182">star,</span> <span begin="1:30.182" end="1:30.521">so</span> <span begin="1:30.521" end="1:30.833">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:30.833" end="1:31.295">keep</span> <span begin="1:31.295" end="1:31.592">moving</span> <span begin="1:31.592" end="1:32.504">on</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">想要成为一颗星星 所以我会继续我的脚步</span></p><p begin="1:33.263" end="1:35.980" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.263" end="1:33.545">I</span> <span begin="1:33.545" end="1:34.198">promise</span> <span begin="1:34.198" end="1:34.772">you</span> <span begin="1:34.772" end="1:35.325">right</span> <span begin="1:35.325" end="1:35.980">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我向你发誓</span></p><p begin="1:36.836" end="1:40.699" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.836" end="1:37.155">So,</span> <span begin="1:37.155" end="1:37.432">Would</span> <span begin="1:37.432" end="1:37.581">you</span> <span begin="1:37.581" end="1:37.897">take</span> <span begin="1:37.897" end="1:38.235">me</span> <span begin="1:38.235" end="1:38.973">back</span> <span begin="1:39.305" end="1:39.541">to</span> <span begin="1:39.541" end="1:40.153">glorious</span> <span begin="1:40.153" end="1:40.699">days</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以，你会将我带回那些辉煌的日子吗</span></p><p begin="1:40.699" end="1:45.534" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.699" end="1:41.336">If</span> <span begin="1:41.336" end="1:41.908">I</span> <span begin="1:41.908" end="1:42.546">lost</span> <span begin="1:42.546" end="1:42.838">the</span> <span begin="1:42.838" end="1:43.398">right</span> <span begin="1:43.398" end="1:43.924">way</span> <span begin="1:43.924" end="1:44.514">to</span> <span begin="1:44.514" end="1:45.534">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果我失去了前行的方向</span></p><p begin="1:46.415" end="1:50.889" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.415" end="1:46.507">And</span> <span begin="1:46.507" end="1:46.633">if</span> <span begin="1:46.633" end="1:47.218">you&apos;d</span> <span begin="1:47.218" end="1:47.713">get</span> <span begin="1:47.713" end="1:48.246">lost,</span> <span begin="1:48.246" end="1:48.573">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:48.573" end="1:48.808">reach</span> <span begin="1:48.808" end="1:49.147">out</span> <span begin="1:49.147" end="1:49.635">my</span> <span begin="1:49.635" end="1:50.064">hands</span> <span begin="1:50.064" end="1:50.889">too</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果你迷失了自己 我也会伸出我的手</span></p><p begin="1:50.889" end="1:55.946" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.889" end="1:51.210">I</span> <span begin="1:51.210" end="1:51.564">hope</span> <span begin="1:51.564" end="1:51.851">we&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:51.851" end="1:52.457">always</span> <span begin="1:52.457" end="1:53.348">support</span> <span begin="1:53.348" end="1:53.874">each</span> <span begin="1:53.874" end="1:55.946">other</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我相信 我们会一直帮助着对方</span></p><p begin="1:55.946" end="1:59.944" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.946" end="1:56.303">So,</span> <span begin="1:56.303" end="1:56.568">Let</span> <span begin="1:56.568" end="1:56.727">me</span> <span begin="1:56.727" end="1:57.061">take</span> <span begin="1:57.061" end="1:57.430">you</span> <span begin="1:57.430" end="1:58.144">down</span> <span begin="1:58.437" end="1:58.591">to</span> <span begin="1:58.591" end="1:58.906">a</span> <span begin="1:58.906" end="1:59.435">radiant</span> <span begin="1:59.435" end="1:59.944">place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以 请同我进入一个流光溢彩的地域</span></p><p begin="1:59.944" end="2:04.854" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.944" end="2:00.504">If</span> <span begin="2:00.504" end="2:01.075">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="2:01.075" end="2:01.331">with</span> <span begin="2:01.331" end="2:01.699">you,</span> <span begin="2:01.699" end="2:02.013">we</span> <span begin="2:02.013" end="2:02.562">can</span> <span begin="2:02.562" end="2:03.128">go</span> <span begin="2:03.128" end="2:03.799">any</span><span begin="2:03.799" end="2:04.854">where</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我心有你 我们可以到达任何地方</span></p><p begin="2:05.587" end="2:07.680" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.587" end="2:05.897">I</span> <span begin="2:05.897" end="2:06.370">know</span> <span begin="2:06.370" end="2:06.781">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:06.781" end="2:07.680">fine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">真好</span></p><p begin="2:08.031" end="2:10.724" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.031" end="2:08.337">The</span> <span begin="2:08.337" end="2:08.631">way</span> <span begin="2:08.631" end="2:08.953">of</span> <span begin="2:08.953" end="2:09.247">truth</span> <span begin="2:09.247" end="2:09.514">is</span> <span begin="2:09.514" end="2:10.724">calling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">真理的方向在向我们招手</span></p><p begin="2:11.011" end="2:14.931" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.011" end="2:11.366">The</span> <span begin="2:11.366" end="2:11.959">wind</span> <span begin="2:11.959" end="2:12.557">is</span> <span begin="2:12.557" end="2:13.157">on</span> <span begin="2:13.157" end="2:13.985">our</span> <span begin="2:13.985" end="2:14.931">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">风伴随着我们</span></p><p begin="2:16.730" end="2:20.311" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.730" end="2:16.990">Can</span> <span begin="2:16.990" end="2:17.113">you</span> <span begin="2:17.113" end="2:17.450">see</span> <span begin="2:17.450" end="2:17.568">the</span> <span begin="2:17.568" end="2:17.922">sun</span> <span begin="2:17.922" end="2:18.527">peeking</span> <span begin="2:18.527" end="2:18.827">through</span> <span begin="2:18.827" end="2:19.105">the</span> <span begin="2:19.105" end="2:20.311">clouds?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你能看见云层中微露的太阳吗</span></p><p begin="2:23.372" end="2:25.676" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.372" end="2:23.956">Teaches</span> <span begin="2:23.956" end="2:24.071">ne</span><span begin="2:24.071" end="2:24.338">ver</span> <span begin="2:24.338" end="2:24.448">for</span><span begin="2:24.448" end="2:24.757">get</span> <span begin="2:24.757" end="2:24.882">no</span> <span begin="2:24.882" end="2:25.204">ma</span><span begin="2:25.204" end="2:25.331">tter</span> <span begin="2:25.331" end="2:25.676">when</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她正指引着我们 无论何时不能忘记我们的梦想</span></p><p begin="2:25.676" end="2:28.342" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.676" end="2:25.962">We</span> <span begin="2:25.962" end="2:26.275">can</span> <span begin="2:26.275" end="2:26.556">find</span> <span begin="2:26.556" end="2:26.695">the</span> <span begin="2:26.695" end="2:27.047">way</span> <span begin="2:27.047" end="2:27.172">no</span> <span begin="2:27.172" end="2:27.431">ma</span><span begin="2:27.431" end="2:27.606">tter</span> <span begin="2:27.606" end="2:27.917">where</span> <span begin="2:27.917" end="2:28.063">we</span> <span begin="2:28.063" end="2:28.342">are</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论身处何处 我们都可以找到前进的方向</span></p><p begin="2:28.342" end="2:30.555" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.342" end="2:28.713">Can</span> <span begin="2:28.713" end="2:29.510">find</span> <span begin="2:29.510" end="2:29.664">the</span> <span begin="2:29.664" end="2:30.555">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一定可以找到的</span></p><p begin="2:31.046" end="2:37.129" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:31.046" end="2:31.648">So</span> <span begin="2:31.648" end="2:32.263">now,</span> <span begin="2:32.263" end="2:32.890">To</span> <span begin="2:32.890" end="2:33.525">be</span> <span begin="2:33.525" end="2:37.129">free</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以现在 放飞自我</span></p><p begin="2:40.156" end="2:43.918" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.156" end="2:40.779">We</span> <span begin="2:40.779" end="2:41.341">can</span> <span begin="2:41.341" end="2:41.888">go</span> <span begin="2:41.888" end="2:42.805">any</span><span begin="2:42.805" end="2:43.918">where</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们可以去任何地方</span></p><p begin="2:43.918" end="2:48.709" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.918" end="2:44.269">The</span> <span begin="2:44.269" end="2:44.722">light</span> <span begin="2:44.722" end="2:45.818">promising</span> <span begin="2:45.818" end="2:46.153">the</span> <span begin="2:46.153" end="2:46.723">future</span> <span begin="2:46.723" end="2:47.179">will</span> <span begin="2:47.179" end="2:47.561">lead</span> <span begin="2:47.561" end="2:48.709">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">曙光向我保证 未来会引领我的路</span></p><p begin="2:48.709" end="2:52.874" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.709" end="2:49.118">So</span> <span begin="2:49.118" end="2:49.410">that</span> <span begin="2:49.410" end="2:49.720">the</span> <span begin="2:49.720" end="2:50.051">dark</span><span begin="2:50.051" end="2:50.334">ness</span> <span begin="2:50.334" end="2:50.912">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:50.912" end="2:51.415">be</span> <span begin="2:51.415" end="2:52.874">approaching</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以黑夜不会降临</span></p><p begin="2:53.643" end="2:57.548" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.643" end="2:53.935">So,</span> <span begin="2:53.935" end="2:54.223">Let</span> <span begin="2:54.223" end="2:54.365">me</span> <span begin="2:54.365" end="2:54.665">take</span> <span begin="2:54.665" end="2:54.974">you</span> <span begin="2:54.974" end="2:55.727">down</span> <span begin="2:56.019" end="2:56.133">to</span> <span begin="2:56.133" end="2:56.458">a</span> <span begin="2:56.458" end="2:57.075">radiant</span> <span begin="2:57.075" end="2:57.548">place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以 请同我进入一个流光溢彩的地域</span></p><p begin="2:57.548" end="3:02.403" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.548" end="2:58.094">If</span> <span begin="2:58.094" end="2:58.670">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="2:58.670" end="2:58.916">with</span> <span begin="2:58.916" end="2:59.279">you,</span> <span begin="2:59.279" end="2:59.617">we</span> <span begin="2:59.617" end="3:00.176">can</span> <span begin="3:00.176" end="3:00.708">go</span> <span begin="3:00.708" end="3:01.433">any</span><span begin="3:01.433" end="3:02.403">where</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我心有你 我们可以到达任何地方</span></p><p begin="3:03.224" end="3:07.839" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.224" end="3:03.540">The</span> <span begin="3:03.540" end="3:03.982">light</span> <span begin="3:03.982" end="3:04.978">promising</span> <span begin="3:04.978" end="3:05.323">the</span> <span begin="3:05.323" end="3:05.915">future</span> <span begin="3:05.915" end="3:06.397">will</span> <span begin="3:06.397" end="3:06.800">lead</span> <span begin="3:06.800" end="3:07.839">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">曙光向我保证 未来会引领我的路</span></p><p begin="3:08.083" end="3:12.352" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.083" end="3:08.364">So</span> <span begin="3:08.364" end="3:08.649">that</span> <span begin="3:08.649" end="3:08.938">the</span> <span begin="3:08.938" end="3:09.198">dark</span><span begin="3:09.198" end="3:09.504">ness</span> <span begin="3:09.504" end="3:10.097">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:10.097" end="3:10.665">be</span> <span begin="3:10.665" end="3:12.352">approaching</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以黑夜不会降临</span></p></div></body></tt>